  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your empathy with worms is uncanny.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Animal companion, mount, or similar class feature, Handle Animal 2 ranks, Knowledge (dungeoneering) 2 ranks, Knowledge (nature) 2 ranks</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can substitute a worm companion for your normal type of animal companion or mount. You treat wormlike creatures (GM’s discretion) as animals for the purpose of using Handle Animal, wild empathy, and any magical effect that affects animals. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus on Handle Animal checks with worm-like creatures and on saving throws against the exceptional and supernatural abilities of worm-like creatures.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/additional-non-mythic-feats#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
